s="material-symbols-outlined mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-xl text-bk-primary" aria-hidden="true">local_shipping</span><div class="min-w-0 flex-1 space-y-1 text-right"><p class="font-bk-body text-[15px] font-bold leading-snug">التوصيل مجاني.</p><p class="font-bk-body text-[13px] leading-snug text-bk-on-secondary/80" data-i18n-field="delivery_sla_i18n">أغلب الطلبات توصل خلال 24 ساعة من تثبيت الطلب</p></div></li><li data-promise-row="call" class="flex min-h-11 items-start gap-3 py-2.5 flex-row-reverse"><span class="material-symbols-outlined mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-xl text-bk-primary" aria-hidden="true">call</span><div class="min-w-0 flex-1 space-y-1 text-right"><p class="font-bk-body text-[15px] font-bold leading-snug">راح يوصلك اتصال من <bdi class="whitespace-nowrap">0777 970 3832</bdi> لتأكيد طلبك — رد علينا ويطلع طلبك</p><a href="data:text/vcard;charset=utf-8,BEGIN%3AVCARD%0D%0AVERSION%3A3.0%0D%0AN%3A%D8%B4%D9%86%D8%A7%D9%8A%D8%AF%D8%B1%20%E2%80%94%20%D8%AA%D8%A3%D9%83%D9%8A%D8%AF%20%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%B7%D9%84%D8%A8%D8%A7%D8%AA%3B%3B%3B%3B%0D%0AFN%3A%D8%B4%D9%86%D8%A7%D9%8A%D8%AF%D8%B1%20%E2%80%94%20%D8%AA%D8%A3%D9%83%D9%8A%D8%AF%20%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%B7%D9%84%D8%A8%D8%A7%D8%AA%0D%0ATEL%3BTYPE%3DCELL%2CVOICE%3A%2B9647779703832%0D%0AEND%3AVCARD" download="شنايدر — تأكيد الطلبات.vcf" data-save-number="true" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-bk-pill border-bk border-bk-on-secondary/40 px-3 font-bk-body text-[13px] font-bold text-bk-on-secondary transition-colors duration-bk-fast hover:bg-bk-on-secondary/10 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-bk-focus motion-reduce:transition-none flex-row-reverse"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base" aria-hidden="true">person_add</span>احفظ رقمنا</a></div></li></ul><p aria-live="polite" data-save-hint="true" class="mt-bk-xs text-center font-bk-body text-[13px] font-bold text-bk-ink-soft sr-only"></p></div></div></form><section data-scent-card="" aria-labelledby="_R_27_" class="space-y-bk-sm rounded-bk-card bg-bk-surface-alt p-4"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 flex-row-reverse"><h2 id="_R_27_" class="font-bk-body text-xs font-black text-bk-ink-soft">بصمة العطر</h2><span class="inline-flex h-7 items-center gap-1 rounded-bk-pill px-2.5 font-bk-body text-xs font-bold border-bk border-bk-divider text-bk-ink-soft flex-row-reverse"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm" aria-hidden="true">man</span>رجالي</span></div><p data-scent-lead="" class="font-bk-display text-[17px] font-extrabold leading-snug text-bk-ink text-balance text-right">فاكهي بلمسة توابل: يبدي بالتوت والتفاح، ويظل عليك بالباتشولي</p><ol aria-label="مكونات العطر" class="divide-y divide-bk-divider"><li data-stage="top" class="flex items-center gap-3 py-3 flex-row-reverse"><p class="w-20 shrink-0 text-right"><span class="block font-bk-display text-sm font-black text-bk-ink">المقدمة</span><span class="block font-bk-body text-xs font-semibold text-bk-ink-soft">أول ما ترشه</span></p><ul class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-wrap items-start gap-3 flex-row-reverse"><li data-note-photo="" class="flex w-[4.5rem] flex-col items-center gap-1 text-center"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="60" height="60" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-[60px] w-[60px] rounded-bk-pill object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsduvpgqwhxragxtxztur.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Ftenant-assets%2Fstore-templates%2Fscheniders%2Fnote-cards%2Fd988d98ad981-0.jpg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsduvpgqwhxragxtxztur.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Ftenant-assets%2Fstore-templates%2Fscheniders%2Fnote-cards%2Fd988d98ad981-0.jpg&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsduvpgqwhxragxtxztur.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Ftenant-assets%2Fstore-templates%2Fscheniders%2Fnote-cards%2Fd988d98ad981-0.jpg&amp;w=128&amp;q=75"/><span class="font-bk-body text-xs font-bold leading-tight text-